{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55278","headline":"赠同居友人 · 符蒙","name":"赠同居友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有情天地内，多感是诗人。\n见月长怜夜，看花又惜春。\n愁爲终日客，闲过少年身。\n寂寞正相对，笙歌满四隣。\n（影印本《诗渊》，第一册第三七七页。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"符蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55278.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55278","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}